  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_eef09f22fefa41549daac837287163ff",
      "statement": "TokenService.generate selects the token generation algorithm based on instrument type: standard cards (InstrumentTypes.CARD) use TokenGenerator.generateCardTokenNumber with the original card number and derive expiry from card data, while accounts (np_card and other instruments) use generateAccountTokenNumber.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/service/TokenService.java#L46-L65",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fdb714f9b13358d2c29ab5dc3232a90a16888d7902005b8376ce777c7a0b3d94:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f7e9c927c7ca4848b8afb0b7d9d97f7b",
      "statement": "Card token numbers preserve the card's leading prefix and trailing suffix digits while replacing the middle with random digits, then append a check digit such that the full number passes AppUtil.validMod10Algorithm, with prefix and suffix lengths configured by token.number.prefix.length and token.number.suffix.length.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/Main.java#L74-L78",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5c4aee5313b8ce5dd6947d16db20e0d0828790b8c492f87cee270f86d6099b2d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/util/TokenGenerator.java#L19-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:72798a19c4486780c11b0a02b11b61222bded6c699d5b6bd06be83cf73c6bd8a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_269ef19e0cc04c0abdaa37a2ae9eb47c",
      "statement": "Account token numbers are generated with a fixed default prefix, random middle digits up to token.number.length.default length, and a trailing Luhn check digit computed by getLuhnChecksumNumbers.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/util/TokenGenerator.java#L51-L73",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:97b33bfddcfb3fad3d5747c81f21952c2a71aba115e47e10baf503c91893810b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5f28b6d55b184aefb28d22274977f8f3",
      "statement": "The Luhn check digit algorithm in getLuhnChecksumNumbers weights every other digit (from the right) by doubling with digit-reduction, sums them, and computes the modulo-10 complement, matching standard Luhn semantics.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/util/TokenGenerator.java#L96-L125",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:03637bbf5a804570a6dfe73f6ee7db2a8cf7caa51c77fff9889a1aa1bfd74654:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_60bb5368a14042eda631c3618825e3cd",
      "statement": "Token expiration is computed by generateTokenExpiredDate as the current date plus token.expiration.month; for international credit cards and recognized domestic bank cards the token expiry is capped to the instrument's own card expiry when the computed date would exceed it.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/util/TokenGenerator.java#L75-L94",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:be7fe1549c7b13d8c549d948e60a1758c0f46e477a7d0a3474876b7d7a36a492:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f35f4ed1978d4178b5c1f17778f53049",
      "statement": "On retrieval, TokenService.get checks the stored token expiry via AppUtil.isExpired; if the token is past its expiry date it is immediately marked EXPIRED (TokenService.updateState) and returned in the expired state.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/service/TokenService.java#L109-L116",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f662772862fc372b9af432f169aef1d07d772a6fb2e19eb28abf4d9c382459b7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7fec35cf884e41bd9a75d37edad81ae7",
      "statement": "During generation, an international credit card whose card expiry has already passed is transitioned to the EXPIRED instrument state via InstrumentService.updateState and token generation aborts with SystemError.INSTRUMENT_EXPIRED.",
